{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-08-24 04:50:00', 'title': "LINDE INAUGURATES WORLD'S FIRST HYDROGEN REFUELING SYSTEM FOR PASSENGER TRAINS", 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / AUGUST 24, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE: LIN; FWB: LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS INAUGURATED THE WORLD'S FIRST HYDROGEN REFUELING SYSTEM FOR PASSENGER TRAINS IN BREMERVÖRDE, GERMANY. LINDE'S HYDROGEN REFUELING SYSTEM, WHICH IT BUILT, OWNS AND OPERATES, WILL REFUEL 14 HYDROGEN-POWERED PASSENGER TRAINS, ENABLING EACH TRAIN TO RUN FOR 1,000 KM EMISSION-FREE ON A SINGLE REFUELING."}